        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Court of King's Bench, Court of King's Bench (England)\n- People: Edward I\n- Concepts: Black Book of the Admiralty, Hammer of the Scots\n\nFacts:\n- Edward I was an English monarch known as the Hammer of the Scots.\n- The most important decisions recorded in the Black Book of the Admiralty were established in the Court of King's Bench.\n- The Court of King's Bench operated under Edward I when those important Black Book of the Admiralty decisions were established.",
